<%# locals: (attempt:) -%>
<%#
  The child's answer and the right one, side by side: nothing red, nothing that marks the
  mistake with a sound of its own, and no timer. The pad marks each digit as it is copied, and the last one removes this element,
  revealing the next question the same response has already rendered underneath.
%>

<div class="correction" data-pad-target="correction">
  <span class="struck"><%= attempt.answer %></span>
  <span class="expected"><%= safe_join attempt.accepted_keys.first.chars.map { tag.span it, data: { pad_target: "expected" } } %></span>
</div>
